/* ClaudeCompatible.swift */
"~/.qwen/settings.json has \"disableAllHooks\": true, so Qwen Code runs no hooks." = "~/.qwen/settings.json 里写着 \"disableAllHooks\": true，Qwen Code 不会运行任何 hook。";
"Remove it (or set it to false), restart qwen, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "删掉这一项（或改成 false），重开 qwen，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
"Gemini CLI runs hooks only in trusted folders: choose to trust the folder the first time you open gemini in a project." = "Gemini CLI 只在信任过的文件夹里运行 hook：第一次在某个项目里打开 gemini 时选择信任。";
"hooksConfig.enabled is false in ~/.gemini/settings.json, so Gemini CLI runs no hooks." = "~/.gemini/settings.json 的 hooksConfig.enabled 是 false，Gemini CLI 不会运行任何 hook。";
"Set it to true (or remove it), restart gemini, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "改成 true（或删掉这一项），重开 gemini，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
"The yaak hook is disabled in Gemini CLI (hooksConfig.disabled)." = "yaak hook 在 Gemini CLI 里被关掉了（hooksConfig.disabled）。";
"In gemini, run /hooks enable %@, or remove it from hooksConfig.disabled in ~/.gemini/settings.json, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 gemini 里输入 /hooks enable %@，或从 ~/.gemini/settings.json 的 hooksConfig.disabled 删掉它，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
"Droid runs no hooks in untrusted folders: choose to trust the folder the first time you open droid in a project." = "Droid 在没信任过的文件夹里不运行任何 hook：第一次在某个项目里打开 droid 时选择信任。";
"Droid has hooksDisabled set to true (~/.factory/settings.json or hooks.json), so it runs no hooks." = "Droid 的 hooksDisabled 是 true（~/.factory/settings.json 或 hooks.json），不会运行任何 hook。";
"Re-enable them with /hooks in droid, or remove the setting, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 droid 里输入 /hooks 重新启用，或删掉这一项，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
"ZCode reads its hook config when a session starts: only sessions opened after installing will report." = "ZCode 在会话开始时读取 hook 配置：装好后新开的会话才会上报。";
"ZCode's main hook switch is off (hooks.enabled in ~/.zcode/cli/config.json)." = "ZCode 的 hook 总开关没开（~/.zcode/cli/config.json 的 hooks.enabled）。";
"Turn it on in ZCode under Settings → Hooks, or set hooks.enabled to true, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 ZCode 的 设置 → Hooks 里打开，或把 hooks.enabled 改成 true，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
"YaaKanban's %@ hooks are disabled in ZCode." = "YaaKanban 的 %@ hook 在 ZCode 里被关掉了。";
"Turn them back on in ZCode under Settings → Hooks, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 ZCode 的 设置 → Hooks 里重新打开，再回到这里点「重新检查」。";
/* Cline.swift */
"Cline's hooks in VS Code follow its “Enable Hooks” switch (on by default). Cline has no permission-request hook, so approvals still happen in Cline. A task that errors in VS Code fires no hook, so its card ends only when stuck detection kicks in." = "Cline 在 VS Code 里的 hook 受「Enable Hooks」开关控制（默认开）。Cline 没有权限请求 hook，批准仍在 Cline 里做。VS Code 里任务出错不会触发 hook，卡片要等卡住检测才结束。";
/* DeepSeek.swift */
"dsh hooks are an experimental interface: no approvals, no session-end event, and no transcript." = "dsh 的 hook 是实验性接口：没有审批、会话结束事件，也没有 transcript。";
"In a terminal, run: dsh plugin --profile web add file:%@" = "在终端里运行：dsh plugin --profile web add file:%@";
"For another profile, replace web with its name (headless, acp…); add it once for each profile you use." = "用别的 profile 就把 web 换成它的名字（headless、acp…）；每个要用的 profile 都加一次。";
"Restart dsh, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "重启 dsh，回到这里点「重新检查」。";
/* Hermes.swift */
"Before Hermes first runs a new hook, it asks you in the terminal to allow each one." = "Hermes 第一次运行新 hook 前会在终端里逐条问你是否允许。";
"Run hermes once in a terminal." = "在终端里运行一次 hermes。";
"It asks about each YaaKanban hook (%lld in total); answer y to all." = "它会逐条询问是否允许 YaaKanban 的 hook，共 %lld 条，都回答 y。";
"Come back and click “Recheck”." = "回到这里点「重新检查」。";
/* JSONHooks.swift */
"Codex runs only the hooks you trusted in /hooks." = "Codex 只运行你在 /hooks 里信任过的 hook。";
