"Windsurf runs no hooks in Restricted Mode; Cascade has no permission-request hook and no session start/end events." = "Windsurf 在 Restricted Mode 下不运行 hook；Cascade 没有权限请求 hook，也没有会话开始/结束事件。";
/* Kimi.swift */
"Kimi Code hooks can't answer permission requests: the card shows it's waiting on you, but you approve in the terminal. If you changed KIMI_CODE_HOME, the hooks aren't installed there." = "Kimi Code 的 hook 不能代答权限请求：卡片会显示在等你，但要回终端里批准。改过 KIMI_CODE_HOME 的话，hook 装不到那里。";
/* Kiro.swift */
"Kiro CLI runs no hooks in untrusted workspaces: choose to trust the workspace the first time you open kiro-cli in a project." = "Kiro CLI 在没信任过的工作区里不运行 hook：第一次在某个项目里打开 kiro-cli 时选择信任。";
